<div class="block04">
    <div class="block04-bg">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-sm-6 col-md-4" style="text-align:center;">
                    <div class="block04__card">
                        <div class="block04__card__img-block">
                            <img src="/assets/images/card01.jpg" alt="" class="block04__card__img-block__img">
                        </div>
                        <div class="block04__card__text-block">
                            <h3 class="block04__card__text-block__title">St. Petersburg</h3>
                            <p>St. Petersburg is the Cultural Capital of our country. The city has a large number of historical and cultural monuments.</p>
                            <p>Students of the Russian-African University will be able to learn about the largest scientific center in Russia.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-sm-6 col-md-4" style="text-align:center;">
                    <div class="block04__card">
                        <div class="block04__card__img-block">
                            <img src="/assets/images/card02.jpg" alt="" class="block04__card__img-block__img">
                        </div>
                        <div class="block04__card__text-block">
                            <h3 class="block04__card__text-block__title">LETI history</h3>
                            <p>As part of an introductory course about St. Petersburg, students will get acquainted with the oldest electrotechnical engineering university in the world.</p>
                            <p>The university was founded in 1886.<br>
                                Today, St. Petersburg Electrotechnical University "LETI" is an educational center with a worldwide reputation, where about 10,000.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-sm-6 col-md-4" style="text-align:center;">
                    <div class="block04__card">
                        <div class="block04__card__img-block">
                            <img src="/assets/images/card03.jpg" alt="" class="block04__card__img-block__img">
                        </div>
                        <div class="block04__card__text-block">
                            <h3 class="block04__card__text-block__title">Discover the world online</h3>
                            <p>Exclusevely for students of the Russian-African University, we have prepared an online course about St. Petersburg and the first Electrotechnical University.</p>
                            <p>Course duration: 3 hours.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
